## Anti-Hallucination Checklist

Before returning any response that includes citations or factual claims:
- [ ] Are all citations verified against an external database?
- [ ] Are all author names confirmed (not generated)?
- [ ] Are all DOIs/PMIDs real and resolvable?
- [ ] Are all journal names real and active?
- [ ] Are all statistical claims traceable to the source?
- [ ] Is AI involvement disclosed appropriately?
